On behalf of the United States, I congratulate the people of Burundi on the 64 th anniversary of your independence on July 1.

The United States values Burundi as a key partner in advancing peace and prosperity across the Great Lakes region.

As you celebrate this National Day, know that the United States stands ready to work alongside Burundi to build a more secure and prosperous future for both our countries. We look forward to strengthening our partnership in the year ahead.